## [integration 3.1.5] - 2026-11-02

### Integrated tools in the header

- The header's empty middle space now hosts the integrated tools: 订阅转换 (converter page), 地区优选 (region IP picker) and SOCKS5 检测 (checker), opening in a new tab so the settings page is never lost.
- 页眉中间的空白区现在放整合工具入口：订阅转换、地区优选、SOCKS5 检测，新标签页打开，不丢设置页状态。

## [integration 3.1.4] - 2026-11-02

### Built-in conversion backend: verifiable, and selectable again

- The subscription-backend dialog treated the built-in entry (empty address) as "no address entered", so it could never pass the availability check — and once an external backend had been confirmed, there was no way back to the built-in default. The built-in entry now runs a real probe (it converts a sample node through the integrated converter) and can be confirmed like any other backend.
- 订阅转换后端弹窗此前把内置转换（地址为空）当成"未输入地址"，永远过不了可用性验证——选过外部后端后也就再切不回默认。现在内置项会做真实实测（用示例节点跑一遍内置转换），验证通过后可像其它后端一样确认切回。

## [integration 3.1.3] - 2026-11-02

### Chain entry field removed from the conversion module

- The chain-entry field added to the subscription-conversion module in 3.1.0 is removed again: a bare link box with no guidance was not usable — chaining belongs to the guided converter page (`/convert`), and the conversion module returns to the upstream field set. (The module's save still preserves config keys it does not know.)
- 撤下 3.1.0 在订阅转换模块里加的链式入口字段：一个没有引导的裸链接框并不好用——链式转换归引导式的转换页（/convert），转换模块恢复上游原有字段集。（该模块保存时保留不认识的配置键这一修复保留。）

## [integration 3.1.2] - 2026-11-02

### Mode presentation no longer overrides the user

- With a saved region selection, the preferred-subscription module presented region mode on every mode recalculation — including when the user explicitly picked Custom, which snapped straight back to region mode and made Custom unreachable. The saved-state presentation now happens once at load; afterwards the mode selector is entirely the user's.
- 修复优选模式被锁死的问题：存有地区筛选时，模块在每次重算时都强制呈现地区模式，用户手动选「自定义订阅」会被立刻弹回，自定义模式实际不可达。现在仅在页面打开时按已存状态呈现一次，之后模式完全由用户切换。

## [integration 3.1.1] - 2026-11-02

### Chain field layout fix

- The chain-entry field in the subscription-conversion module rendered squeezed into columns (its wrapper inherited a flex row). It now uses the module's standard label + control row, with the hint and the fill/clear actions stacked below at full width — the same arrangement as the module's other fields.
- 修复订阅转换模块里链式入口字段的排版：此前它被挤成多列，现改为与模块其它字段一致的标准行（标签 + 输入框），说明与填入/清空操作在下方整宽排列。

## [integration 3.1.0] - 2026-11-02

### Fused, not spliced: additions become the base features' own forms

- The runtime-injected modules are gone. Region filtering is now a fourth mode of the preferred-subscription module itself — alongside generator / random / custom — rendered in the module's own controls, saved through the module's own Save button, and persisted in the config (`优选订阅生成.本地IP库.地区筛选`). Fresh installs start in this mode (JP-HK-SG-US, up to 10 nodes per region).
- 运行时注入的模块全部退役。按地区筛选成为优选订阅生成模块自身的第四种模式（与生成器/随机/自定义并列），用模块自己的控件呈现、走模块自己的保存通道、存进配置（优选订阅生成.本地IP库.地区筛选）；新部署开箱即在此模式（JP-HK-SG-US、每地区最多 10 个）。
- The chain entry is now a plain field inside the subscription-conversion module, saved by that module's own Save button. The module's save also no longer discards config keys it does not know — it used to rebuild the object and silently drop the chain entry and the built-in-converter flag.
- 链式入口成为订阅转换模块里的一个普通字段，由该模块自己的「保存」落盘；同时修复该模块保存时会重建配置对象、把链式入口与内置转换标记等不认识的键悄悄丢弃的问题。
- On a fresh install, the admin's preferred-IP list now reports the filter entry the subscription actually uses, instead of a random-IP list; the built-in converter is labelled as the default conversion, with external backends kept as an alternative.
- 新部署下，后台优选列表如实显示订阅实际使用的筛选条目，不再显示一串随机 IP；内置转换标注为默认转换方式，外部后端保留为备选。

## [integration 3.0.0] - 2026-11-01

### Admin UI returns to the upstream layout, with this project's features fused in

- The admin and login pages are once again the upstream EDT-Pages pages (vendored into the Worker, still fully self-hosted — nothing is fetched from the Pages site at runtime), so upstream users keep their exact operating habits. No upstream feature was removed.
- 管理与登录页恢复为上游 EDT-Pages 页面（内嵌进 Worker，依然完全自托管，运行时不从 Pages 站点抓取），上游用户的操作习惯原样保留，上游功能一个未删。
- This project's features are fused in as native modules of the same page: a Chain module next to the converter settings, a region picker inside the preferred-subscription module (tick regions instead of collecting addresses), a tools module linking the region filter / proxy checker / chain converter pages, and the built-in converter offered as the first backend option. Data and update endpoints point at this repository's self-hosted copies.
- 本项目功能以同页原生模块的形式融合：订阅转换旁的链式代理模块、优选订阅生成内的地区勾选（勾地区代替收集地址）、整合工具模块（地区筛选/代理检测/链式转换入口），内置转换列为后端第一选项；数据与更新端点指向本仓库的自托管副本。

## [integration 2.6.0] - 2026-11-01

### Written for first-time deployers

- The overview gains a dismissible four-step first-run guide (pick regions, copy the subscription link, import it into a client, explore the advanced pages later), and the README gains a matching Quick start section.
- 概览页新增可关闭的四步上手清单（选地区、复制订阅链接、导入客户端、再探索进阶页），README 同步新增「快速开始」一节。
- The chain panel now speaks in plain deployer terms: the normal case (an external entry from another airport or deployment) comes first, filling in this deployment's own nodes is labelled by its actual effect (the landing does not change), and insider shorthand like the coined term for the probed candidate pool was replaced with plain wording across the console.
- 链式面板改用普通部署者的话术：外部入口这一常规用法在前，填入本部署自身节点时如实标注其实际效果（落地不变）；全控制台清掉自造黑话（如候选池的简称），换成 plain 说法。

## [integration 2.5.0] - 2026-11-01

### Settings reorganized around tasks; chain gets its own panel

- The settings page no longer mirrors the raw config schema: every group opens with a plain-language summary of what it is for, the reverse-proxy group is split into its two alternative modes plus a templates area, and the converter's external-backend field disables itself while the built-in converter is on.
- 设置页不再照搬配置结构：每个分组开头有一句人话说明；反代组按两种方式分区、路径模板单列；启用内置转换时，外部 SUBAPI 字段自动禁用。
- The chain entry moved out of the converter form into a dedicated Chain panel on the subscription page: it draws the entry-to-exit path, shows the current entry state (including an honest self-chain label when the entry is this deployment's own snapshot), and offers replace / refresh-snapshot / clear actions.
- 链式入口从订阅转换表单里拆出，成为订阅页的独立「链式代理」面板：画清入口到出口的路径，显示当前入口状态（入口是本部署自身快照时会如实标注「自链」），提供更换、刷新快照、清空三个操作。

## [integration 2.4.0] - 2026-11-01

### Guidance everywhere and upstream-parity details

- Every settings field now carries a one-line explanation, every section opens with a guidance line, and key selects annotate their options (ECH DNS providers, ECH-capable fingerprints, transport use cases).
- 每个设置字段都带一行说明，每个分区顶部有一句引导语，关键下拉的选项带注释（ECH DNS 服务商、支持 ECH 的指纹、传输协议适用场景）。
- ECH linkage: choosing a domestic DoH preset automatically pairs the ECH SNI with cloudflare-ech.com.
- ECH 联动：选用国内 DoH 预设时，ECH 解析域名自动配为 cloudflare-ech.com。
- The settings save button stays disabled until something actually changes; the Cloudflare usage group gained a verify button that checks the credentials currently typed, without saving first.
- 设置保存按钮在没有改动时保持禁用；Cloudflare 用量组新增「验证凭据并查询用量」，用当前填写的值直接验证，无需先保存。
- Network module: the walled-egress card can switch between X.com and ChatGPT, and clicking an IP opens a detail view (location, provider, ASN, timezone).
- 网络模块：墙外测试卡可在 X.com 与 ChatGPT 之间切换来源；点击 IP 可打开详情（地区、运营商、ASN、时区）。
- The update panel displays the changelog inline; the operation log gained a time column; an overview banner warns when the current domain is not in the host list.
- 更新面板可直接在页内查看更新日志；操作日志补上时间列；当前域名不在主机列表中时，概览会出现提醒横幅。

## [integration 2.3.0] - 2026-11-01

### Collapsible panels, per-format subscription links, network module

- Every panel in the console can be collapsed with the chevron at its top-right corner; the state is remembered per panel.
- 管理台所有面板都可用右上角箭头折叠，折叠状态按面板记忆。
- The subscription section lists one link per format - adaptive, Base64, Clash, sing-box, Surge, Loon, Quantumult X - each masked by default with show / copy / QR actions.
- 订阅区按格式逐行列出链接：自适应、Base64、Clash、sing-box、Surge、Loon、Quantumult X，默认打码，各带显示 / 复制 / 二维码。
- New Current Network module on the overview: four egress checks (domestic, international, Cloudflare via this deployment's own endpoint, and a walled-site probe) plus an eight-site latency grid; IPs are masked by default and revealed per card on click.
- 概览新增「当前网络信息」模块：四路出口检测（国内、国外、Cloudflare 本部署回显、墙外）加八站延迟栅格；IP 默认脱敏，点击卡片才显示真实值。

## [integration 2.2.3] - 2026-11-01

### Reset and update, in this project's own image — plus more convenience

- The two upstream facilities left unrestored in 2.2.2 return as this project's own versions. **Reset**: the Advanced page gains a danger zone that restores the runtime's factory defaults — but keeps the deployment's identity (UUID, hosts, subscription token), any Telegram/Cloudflare credentials, the chain entry, and the random-IP-off baseline; before resetting it downloads a backup of the current config and keeps a browser-local copy, so **恢复上次备份 (restore backup)** undoes a reset in one click. **Updates**: the overview gains a version panel that checks this repository's CHANGELOG for the latest integration version and links to the changelog and the repo — no upstream addresses involved.
- 2.2.2 里没补的两项（重置配置、更新面板）以自有版本回归：重置保留身份、凭据与链式入口，执行前下载备份且可一键撤销；更新面板查本仓库的 CHANGELOG 判断是否有新版本。
- Settings gains a **simple mode** (常用分组 only — the advanced groups hide), the gRPC UserAgent field gains a "fill with the current browser UA" button, the security self-check adds a built-in-conversion item, and the log view gains a text filter.
- 设置加简洁模式；gRPC UserAgent 可一键填入当前浏览器 UA；安全自检加「订阅转换走内置」一项；日志加过滤框。

## [integration 2.2.2] - 2026-11-01

### Console convenience restored to upstream parity

- A field-by-field comparison against the upstream admin found places where the self-built console had quietly simplified the original controls. All fixed-value settings are dropdowns again — transport protocol, ALPN, fingerprint, gRPC mode, Shadowsocks cipher, and the preferred-IP port (random = -1, or a common TLS port). No capability was dropped in the restyle; these are restorations, verified one by one.
- 对照上游原版逐项核查后，把自研管理台里被简化掉的操作便利全部补回：传输协议、ALPN、指纹、gRPC 模式、Shadowsocks 加密方式、指定端口都改回下拉选择。
- ECH DNS / SNI are preset pickers with a custom-value escape hatch; the converter's SUBAPI and config URL fields offer the preset lists from this repository's own `data/` files; the reverse-proxy section gains the path-template library (whole template sets applied in one pick). Three settings the form was missing entirely — aggregated subscription, the SOCKS5 account protocol, and the chain entry — are editable now.
- ECH 改预设下拉加自定义；订阅转换的后端与配置地址可从本仓库数据文件的预设中选；反代加路径模板库整套套用；补回汇聚订阅、SOCKS5 账号协议、链式入口三个设置项。
- Subscription and node links get QR-code buttons (generated offline in the page with the vendored qrcode-generator library, MIT). The overview adds a security self-check strip, and the log view shows all records.
- 订阅与节点链接加二维码（页面内离线生成）；概览加安全自检；日志显示全部记录。

## [integration 2.2.1] - 2026-11-01

### Privacy: the hostname is masked too

- The console overview no longer prints the deployment hostname in plain text: it is masked by default (`••••••••.cc`) with show/copy actions, like the credentials around it. The subscription and node link masks were tightened at the same time — they now keep only the URL scheme and the last four characters.
- 管理台概览的主机名改为默认打码（只留顶级后缀，带显示/复制），订阅与节点链接的打码同步收紧为只留协议头与末四位。

## [integration 2.2] - 2026-11-01

### The admin is ours now — pages replaced, not re-skinned

- The admin console and login page are **this project's own pages**, served by the deployment itself: a left-rail console (Overview / Subscription / Region Filter / Tools / Settings / Advanced / Logs) and a split-wall login page. The upstream page proxy — and the theme-injection layer that re-skinned it — are gone entirely; no user-facing page is fetched from any external page service (the not-configured notice pages are self-served too). Login, logout, config editing (form + raw JSON), region editing, ADD.txt editing and the log view all run against the same admin APIs as before.
- The three tool pages got **structural** layouts of their own, not new colors: the IP filter is now a two-pane workbench (a scrollable region rail beside the results pane), the proxy checker a single-column workspace with its summary as a top strip and the ambient layers removed, the converter a two-column form with the short-link restore card as a right rail.
- Subscription and node links in the console are masked by default; the overview shows only the last four characters of the UUID.
- 管理台与登录页改为本项目自研页面、由部署自身下发（左侧栏七区管理台 + 分栏品牌墙登录页），上游页面代理与注入换肤层整体移除，无任何用户可见页面再从外部页面服务抓取（未配置提示页也自带）；登录、退出、配置编辑（表单 + 原始 JSON）、地区编辑、ADD.txt 编辑与日志查看沿用原有后台接口。三个工具页做骨架级重排：筛选页双栏工作台（可滚动地区栏 + 结果区）、检测页单列工作区加顶部状态条并去除氛围层、转换页双列表单加恢复右轨。订阅与节点链接默认打码，概览中的 UUID 只显示末四位。

## [integration 2.1] - 2026-11-01

### One visual identity, clearly this project's own

- The project's own design language (see DESIGN.md: near-black teal canvas, four-step surfaces, hairline borders, one teal→blue accent) now covers **every page** — admin, login, the IP filter, the proxy checker and the converter — and is on by default (`?design=0` opts out). The upstream orange brand gradient is gone everywhere, including the login emblem and embedded tool views; light mode maps the same hierarchy. Side-by-side with upstream, the pages are unmistakably different products.
- The filter page no longer loads anything from a CDN: its styles are precompiled and inlined at build time, icons are inline SVG, fonts use system stacks. The checker page draws country flags as emoji (no third-party flag-image service) and uses system font stacks too. The admin page's data fetches no longer route through third-party GitHub mirror domains, its preferred-IP API example points at the deployment's own `/ips` endpoint, and the embedded optimizer view is titled by function.
- The README credits section now lists everything the project integrates, embeds or calls — source projects, the admin-page project, the IP dataset, VPNGate, the proxy-check service, UsagePanel, ACL4SSR, the rule-set providers (MetaCubeX, SagerNet) and the vendored libraries (js-yaml, Leaflet/OpenStreetMap, Lucide, Tailwind CSS).
- 全站视觉统一为本项目设计语言并与上游明显区分（橙色品牌渐变全量清零、浅色模式同映射、设计层默认开启）；筛选页零 CDN（样式预编译内嵌、图标内联、系统字体），检测页国旗改 emoji、字体本地化；后台数据路径改直连、示例改指本部署 /ips 接口；README 鸣谢按「引用必致谢」补齐全部来源。

## [integration 2.0] - 2026-11-01

### All six formats are native now — zero external dependencies

- The integrated converter renders **all six** target formats in-process: Clash / Mihomo, sing-box, and now **V2Ray, Surge, Loon and Quantumult X natively** (1.7–1.11 relayed the last four to an external subconverter). The `EXTERNAL_SUBCONVERTER_URL` passthrough is removed entirely — nothing in the conversion path leaves the deployment, and the admin note by the 订阅转换后端 field says so. Chaining is available in every format that can express it: Surge via `underlying-proxy`, Loon via its `[Proxy Chain]` section, Quantumult X via `via-server`; V2Ray degrades to a plain link collection (the format has no policy groups). Quantumult X output uses the client's real section names (`[server_local]` / `[policy]`). Short links, the `/conv` / `/chain` / `/sub?url=` endpoints and region filtering (`regions=`) work for all six targets.
- Honest limits, set by client capability: Surge has no VLESS or TUIC — such nodes are skipped, and if nothing renderable remains the converter answers an explicit error instead of an empty shell (through edgetunnel's `/sub` bridge this surfaces as a clear 422 explanation, never a garbage fetch). gRPC transport is not rendered for Surge / Loon / Quantumult X. The full protocol × format matrix and the per-format chain notes live in the converter project's `NATIVE_FORMATS_REPORT.md`. Quantumult X chain (`via-server`) follows the community-documented syntax and is flagged there for real-client verification.
- Per the project's structure rule, the converter-core upgrade landed in the source project first (dukangalex/subscription-chain-converter-cf) and was then re-vendored into this build.
- 六种格式全部原生、零外部依赖：转换核心现在在进程内直接生成全部六种格式（V2Ray / Surge / Loon / Quantumult X 不再透传外部 subconverter，透传通道整体移除）；链式在各格式按其原生机制实现（Surge 的 underlying-proxy、Loon 的 [Proxy Chain] 段、Quantumult X 的 via-server；V2Ray 无策略组概念，退化为链接集合）。诚实边界：Surge 无 VLESS/TUIC（跳过，无可渲染节点时明确报错、/sub 桥接返回 422 说明，绝不输出空壳或乱抓）；grpc 传输在 Surge/Loon/QuanX 不渲染；协议×格式完整矩阵见转换器项目的 NATIVE_FORMATS_REPORT.md（其中 QuanX 的 via-server 为社区语法、标注待真机验证）。核心升级先落转换器原项目、再按结构规矩收进整合版。

## [integration 1.11] - 2026-11-01

### Contact information on every product surface

- Standing rule set by the project owner (2026-11-01): every shipped product surface must carry contact information — the project repository and the official channel — so users can find the source and report problems. First catch-up under the rule: the `/convert` page previously contained no links at all; its injected page script now appends a contact footer （项目仓库 GitHub · 交流频道 Telegram) pointing at the same destinations as the admin footer (1.8). A regression test asserts both links are present in the served page.
- 成品必带联系方式（项目定版）：/convert 页此前零链接，现由注入脚本在页脚补齐联系方式——项目仓库与官方频道，与后台页脚（1.8）同一指向；回归测试已断言两条链接存在于下发页面中。

## [integration 1.10] - 2026-11-01

### Everything points home

- **The admin page now references only this project**: the version check (`WORKER_VERSION_SOURCE_URL`), the changelog (`CHANGELOG_RAW_URL`) and the Pages package download (`PAGES_ZIP_DOWNLOAD_URL`) were rewritten at serve time to this repository; the footer's social links were already switched in 1.8. The runtime data files the page used to fetch from the upstream author's personal repository — `SUBCONFIG.json`, `SUBAPI.json`, `json/edt-path-config.json`, `json/best-cf-tools.json`, `CF-CIDR.txt` — are vendored under `data/` in this repository and the page fetches them from here. The IP-info lookup the page used to send to the upstream author's API is answered by the deployment itself (`GET /api/ipinfo`, admin-gated, same field shape). The ADD.txt help example for a hosted subscription generator now shows this project's built-in `ipf://` entry instead. The subscription-conversion backend placeholder no longer advertises the upstream public backend.
- Deliberately **not** rewritten: live third-party services the admin features call (the proxy-IP check service and its CF list endpoints, the public SSTP pool list), the GitHub fetch mirrors (transport only), the proxy core's built-in default reverse-proxy service domain (a functional default, overridable via PROXYIP), and attribution/thanks links. None of them is this deployment's home, backend, or update source anymore.
- 全部指向本项目：后台的版本检查、更新日志、程序包下载在下发时改指本仓库（页脚已在 1.8 更换）；页面原先从上游作者个人仓库取的五个运行时数据文件（SUBCONFIG、SUBAPI、路径模板、工具清单、CF-CIDR）已收进本仓库 data/ 目录并改从这里取；IP 信息查询改由本部署自建的 /api/ipinfo 回答（登录把关、字段一致）；优选案例里的托管生成器示例换成本项目内置 ipf:// 条目；订阅转换后端占位提示不再出现上游公共后端。未改的只剩：后台功能实际调用的第三方在线服务（PROXYIP 检测与其 CF 列表、SSTP 公开池）、GitHub 拉取镜像（仅传输）、代理核心的默认反代服务域名（功能性默认，可由 PROXYIP 覆盖）与致谢链接——它们都不再是本部署的归属、后端或更新来源。

## [integration 1.9] - 2026-11-01

### One whole: the modules now work for each other

- **The checker serves this deployment**: the `/socks5-ui` page gains a 🔗 本部署一体化 panel — `/socks5/self-nodes` lists the nodes the current subscription actually contains (the living pool's real expansion) with each node's latest probe status/latency from the health registry, and `/socks5/check-config` verifies the admin-configured SOCKS5 upstream with the check engine (the account is used server-side only; responses show host:port, never credentials). Both endpoints sit behind the same admin login as the checker itself.
- **The filter joins conversion**: `/conv`, `/chain` and `/sub?url=` accept `regions=JP-HK` — converted output keeps only nodes from those regions. Detection order: flag emoji / localized name / country code in the node name, then a reverse lookup of IP hosts in the filter's own dataset; nodes whose region cannot be determined are kept, never silently dropped. The `/convert` page gains a matching 🌏 按国家筛选转换 bar. (Short links and the external-passthrough formats are unchanged.)
- **Shared status**: the admin 🧰 整合工具 card now shows the shared pool's vitality (candidates / confirmed alive / dropped dead) — one pool, four modules.
- 融为一体：检测页新增 🔗 本部署一体化面板——/socks5/self-nodes 列出当前订阅实际包含的节点（活池真实展开）及各自健康档案中的最近探测状态与延迟；/socks5/check-config 用检测引擎验证后台已配置的 SOCKS5 反代（账号仅服务端使用，响应只出现主机:端口、绝不带凭据），两接口与检测页同一登录把关。转换接口 /conv、/chain、/sub?url= 新增 regions 参数，转换任何订阅都能按国家筛选（判定顺序：名称旗帜/中文名/国家码 → IP 数据集反查；判不出的保留不丢）。/convert 页加同款筛选条；后台工具卡显示四模块共用的节点池活性。

## [integration 1.8] - 2026-11-01

### Built-in converter is the default; project identity in the admin page

- **The integrated converter is now the default, visibly**: the shipped default for 订阅转换配置.SUBAPI is empty, and empty means "use this project's built-in converter" — Clash / sing-box are generated in-process (chain included), V2Ray / Surge / Loon / Quantumult X go through the converter interface's `EXTERNAL_SUBCONVERTER_URL` passthrough. Upstream's public backend is no longer the default for new deployments (existing deployments keep their saved config). If neither a passthrough nor a backend is configured, non-native formats answer a clear 501 instead of fetching a meaningless relative URL. Passthrough requests forward edgetunnel's full parameter set (config template, emoji, udp, sort, …), which the backend's output depends on.
- **Admin page entry points**: a 🧰 整合工具 card at the top of the settings area links all three integrated modules （国家优选筛选 / 代理检测 / 订阅转换）; the 订阅转换后端 field carries a placeholder and a note explaining the built-in default; the page footer's social links now point to this project (GitHub repository and the author's channel) instead of upstream's.
- 订阅转换默认即内置并明示：新装默认 SUBAPI 为空，空即用本项目内置转换（Clash/sing-box 原生含链式，其余四格式经 EXTERNAL_SUBCONVERTER_URL 透传），不再默认走上游公共后端（已保存配置的部署不受影响）；无任何外部后端时非原生格式明确返回 501 说明；透传会转发 edgetunnel 的完整参数集（config 模板等，后端产出依赖它们）。后台设置区顶部新增 🧰 整合工具卡（三个整合模块一级入口），「订阅转换后端」输入框加内置默认说明，页脚社交链接改指本项目（仓库与作者频道）。

## [integration 1.7] - 2026-10-31

### Integrated subscription converter (subscription-chain-converter-cf)

- The chain-proxy subscription converter joins the same deployment as its subscription conversion interface, so all six target formats are covered:
  - **Clash / Mihomo and sing-box are generated natively in-process** (plain and chained: entry/exit auto-select groups, `dialer-proxy` / `detour` chaining, official rule skeletons) — no external service involved.
  - **V2Ray / Surge / Loon / Quantumult X** are relayed to an external subconverter you configure via the `EXTERNAL_SUBCONVERTER_URL` Worker variable — the same architecture the standalone converter uses; without it those targets return a clear 501 explanation instead of failing silently.
- edgetunnel's own `/sub` conversion now prefers the built-in converter for Clash / sing-box: automatic when no `SUBAPI` is configured, forced with `订阅转换配置.内置转换: true`. Set `订阅转换配置.链式入口` to an entry subscription (URL or `|`-separated node links) and converted subscriptions come out chained. When an external `SUBAPI` is configured and built-in is not forced, behavior is unchanged; any built-in failure falls back to the external backend.
- The converter's own surface is included: page at `/convert`, `POST /shorten` + `/m|s|c/<code>` short links (KV only, no D1/R2 needed), `/api/link/<code>`, direct `/conv`, `/chain` and `/sub?url=` endpoints.
- Rule files are mirrored **lazily** into the existing KV: generated configs reference `<your-domain>/rules/<dst>`, each file is fetched from its official source on first use, validated and cached; `POST /rules-refresh` (admin) warms the whole mirror, `GET /rules-status` (admin) reports the last refresh.
- 订阅转换器融入同一部署，成为本项目的订阅转换接口，六种目标格式齐全：Clash/Mihomo 与 sing-box 由内置核心原生生成（含链式：入口/出口优选组 + dialer-proxy/detour），不依赖任何外部服务；V2Ray/Surge/Loon/Quantumult X 经可配置的外部转换接口透传（变量 EXTERNAL_SUBCONVERTER_URL，与原版转换器同一架构），未配置时明确返回 501 说明。edgetunnel 自身 /sub 的转换优先走内置（未配 SUBAPI 时自动启用，或以「订阅转换配置.内置转换: true」强制）；配置「订阅转换配置.链式入口」后，转换结果自动带链。短链（仅用 KV）、/convert 页面、/conv /chain /sub?url= 直出接口一并保留；规则文件按需懒镜像进既有 KV，首次使用时从官方源拉取校验后缓存。

## [integration 1.6] - 2026-10-31

### Integrated proxy checker (CF-Workers-CheckSocks5)

- The proxy availability checker joins the same deployment: page at `/socks5-ui`, APIs under `/socks5/*` (`check`, `resolve`, `resolve-batch`, `locations`, `ip.json`) — SOCKS5 / HTTP / HTTPS / TURN / SSTP single & batch checks with exit-IP details.
- Upstream ships **without any authentication**; in this integration every checker route is gated by the deployment's own admin login (page redirects to `/login`, APIs return 401), so it cannot be abused as a public probing tool.
- The whole checker module is wrapped in an IIFE (zero symbol leakage — it embeds a vendored TLS library); its default footer was replaced because the original phoned a third-party visit counter with the deployment's hostname.
- 代理检测融入同一部署：页面 /socks5-ui、接口 /socks5/*，支持 SOCKS5/HTTP/HTTPS/TURN/SSTP 单条与批量检测和出口信息。原项目无鉴权，整合版全部路由由部署自身的后台登录把关（页面跳登录、接口 401），杜绝被当作公开探测工具。模块整体包在 IIFE 内零符号泄漏；原默认页脚会向第三方统计服务上报部署域名，已替换为中性页脚。

## [integration 1.5] - 2026-10-31

### Living pool + its own UI identity

- **Living node pool**: the upstream candidate list is now only a source. At subscription generation time, candidates for every `ipf://` region are probed in-process (TCP connect), dead ones are dropped, the fastest live ones are selected, and outcomes are remembered in a KV health registry (`IPF_health_v1`) — proven nodes are preferred, repeat-dead nodes are avoided, and the pool continuously heals itself through normal use. No cron, no extra setup; without socket support it degrades to plain sampling. The admin card shows pool vitality via `/?pool_stats=1`.
- **UI identity**: the proxied admin and login pages receive the project's own theme (teal→blue brand gradient, branded primary buttons, selection/scrollbar accents) plus a floating 🌏 badge that opens the filter page; the settings card gets a matching gradient header and controls; the filter page itself is retitled to the project name.
- 活池：上游候选表只作来源。订阅生成时逐地区进程内实测（TCP 连接探测），死节点剔除、最快者入选，结果记入 KV 健康档案（IPF_health_v1）——验过的优先、反复死亡的避开，池子在使用中自我修复。无定时任务、无额外配置；无 socket 环境时退化为普通采样。后台卡片经 /?pool_stats=1 显示节点池活性。
- UI 差异化：代理下发的后台与登录页注入本项目主题（青绿→蓝品牌渐变、品牌主按钮、选区/滚动条点缀）与 🌏 悬浮徽章（点开筛选页）；设置卡片换上同色渐变头与控件；筛选页标题改为项目名。

## [integration 1.4.1] - 2026-10-31

### Fix

- Admin card injection anchored to the **last** `</body>` — the upstream admin page embeds a `<template>` whose content contains a literal `</body>`, and injecting at the first occurrence buried the script inside the template where it never runs. The injected admin response is also marked `Cache-Control: no-store` so the shell can never go stale after an upgrade.
- 管理页卡片注入改为锚定**最后一个** `</body>`——上游管理页内嵌的 `<template>` 内容里有一个字面量 `</body>`，注入到第一个会出现脚本被埋进模板、永不执行。注入后的管理页同时标注 `Cache-Control: no-store`，杜绝外壳缓存导致升级后看不到新版。

## [integration 1.4] - 2026-10-31

### Built-in admin entry

- The admin page gains a 「🌏 内置国家优选」 card above the custom-IP editor (the upstream admin UI is proxied, so the card is injected while serving it — fully defensive: any failure leaves the original page untouched). Region chips are loaded from the deployment's own region list, the per-region count is a plain number input, and 启用并保存 / 停用 write through the admin's own `/admin/ADD.txt` channel. The card reflects the current `ipf://` state on open and warns when the subscription mode is not set to custom.
- 管理页新增内置入口卡片：位于自定义优选编辑器上方（上游管理页为代理加载，卡片在下发时注入，全防御式，失败不影响原页面）。地区选项从本部署的地区列表实时加载，数量为普通数字输入，启用/停用经后台自有 `/admin/ADD.txt` 通道保存；打开页面即显示当前 `ipf://` 状态，订阅模式非自定义时给出提示。

## [integration 1.3] - 2026-10-31

### Deployment parity

- The repository is now complete for upstream-style deployment: `img.png` is included, and the README deployment section mirrors edgetunnel's three quick paths (Pages upload / Pages + GitHub / Workers) with the same finishing steps (`ADMIN` variable + KV binding named `KV`) and zero extra configuration for the filter.
- 仓库部署完整度与上游对齐：补齐 `img.png`，README 部署章节与上游一致的三条快速路径（Pages 上传 / Pages + GitHub / Workers），同样的收尾步骤（`ADMIN` 变量 + 名为 `KV` 的 KV 绑定），筛选功能零额外配置。

## [integration 1.2] - 2026-10-31

### Change

- Fresh deployments now use the built-in filter out of the box: random-IP mode defaults to OFF, and with no custom preferred-IP list set, subscription generation falls back to the default entry `ipf://JP-HK-SG-US?limit=10`. The entry is ordinary editable data — any regions, any per-region limit, multiple `ipf://` lines, mixed with hand-written entries — and takes effect on the next subscription fetch.
- 新装开箱即走内置筛选：随机 IP 模式默认关闭，未设置自定义优选列表时订阅生成自动使用默认条目 `ipf://JP-HK-SG-US?limit=10`。该条目是可自由编辑的普通数据——地区、单地区数量、多条 `ipf://`、与手写条目混排均可，改完下一次拉订阅即生效。

## [integration 1.1] - 2026-10-31

### Integration

- The IP filter and the proxy core are now one self-contained unit: subscription generation expands `ipf://<regions>?limit=N` entries in the preferred-IP list (KV `ADD.txt`) in-process through the built-in filter module, so `/sub` serves country-filtered preferred IPs from the same deployment with no HTTP self-request and no external filter service.
- 筛选与代理主体合为一体：订阅生成在进程内展开优选列表（KV `ADD.txt`）中的 `ipf://<地区>?limit=N` 条目，`/sub` 直接产出本部署的国家优选节点，无 HTTP 自调用、不依赖外部筛选服务。

### Optimization

- `config.json` is cached as raw text in-isolate for 30 seconds (admin saves invalidate immediately) instead of one KV read per request; the preferred-IP list source is read once instead of twice; a failed subscription-conversion call is retried once.
- 配置原文 isolate 内缓存 30 秒（后台保存立即失效）；优选列表源只读一次 KV；订阅转换失败自动重试一次。

